message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Logistics support agent"
abstract: >-
  A neurosymbolic logistics support agent built with the cognition library. It quotes delivery prices
  for a small-fleet carrier: a language model understands the request, while a world graph and a
  search planner work out the cheapest way to deliver a shipment and what it costs.
